OL,3,GNEWSASocial club fire believed to be   
OL,4,Aarson                                  
OL,6,FA fire at a former social club is      
OL,7,Fbelieved to have been started          
OL,8,Fdeliberately, firefighters have        
OL,9,Fconfirmed.                             
OL,11,FCrews responded to the blaze at the    
OL,12,Fhistoric Standard Triumph Club, on Tile
OL,13,FHill Lane, Coventry, shortly after     
OL,14,F19:55 GMT on Tuesday.                  
OL,16,FFour fire engines and two hydraulic    
OL,17,Faerial platforms from Coventry, Canley,
OL,18,FFoleshill, Binley and Highgate attended
OL,19,Fthe scene.                             
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
