OL,3,GNEWSASocial club fire believed to be   
OL,4,Aarson                                  
OL,6,FA spokesperson for West Midlands Fire  
OL,7,FService confirmed no casualties or     
OL,8,Finjuries had been reported, but said   
OL,9,Fthe fire was "believed to have been    
OL,10,Fstarted deliberately".                 
